---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
---

<Base
  title="Terms"
  description="Draft terms for reading, linking to, and using the educational content on this website."
>
  <div class="container narrow section" data-legal-review="pending">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Using this website</p><h1>
        A few shared expectations.
      </h1><p>Last updated 6 November 2026.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="callout">
        Draft terms — legal review is pending. The owner must confirm its legal
        identity, contact route, rights ownership, applicable law, and final
        terms before public launch. These details have not yet been supplied.
      </p>
      <h2>Educational use</h2>
      <p>
        You may read and link to {site.name} for general information. Read the <a
          href="/disclaimer/">medical disclaimer</a
        > to understand its limits. The site does not provide personal care, crisis
        response, or professional advice. There are no reader accounts or comment
        features.
      </p>
      <h2>Sharing and permissions</h2>
      <p>
        Links to original pages are welcome. Reproducing an article, publishing
        a translation, or using substantial parts of the content may require
        permission from the confirmed rights holder. The owner must supply
        licensing details and a permission contact. This draft does not grant an
        open-content licence or establish ownership.
      </p>
      <h2>Respectful use</h2>
      <p>
        Do not distribute malicious material, disrupt the site, misrepresent the
        source of content, or attempt unauthorized access. Do not send health
        information through a general newsletter field or unverified contact
        route.
      </p>
      <h2>Accuracy and changes</h2>
      <p>
        Pages can be edited, moved, or removed. The current samples await human
        review. An article's date is not a guarantee that all information or
        linked services remain current. The owner must maintain a correction
        process described in the <a href="/editorial-policy/"
          >editorial policy</a
        >.
      </p>
      <h2>Other services and privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Outside websites, newsletter providers, and media platforms have their
        own terms and privacy notices. Review them when you choose to use a
        service. Our <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a> describes the website's
        current configuration and the details still awaiting confirmation.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact and legal review</h2>
      <p>
        See <a href="/contact/">contact availability</a> for the current status. No
        jurisdiction, dispute process, or liability waiver is asserted by this draft.
        A qualified legal reviewer must decide what terms are appropriate for the
        actual operator and audience.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
